  "brief": "Redesign an existing local-first desktop web workbench for solo AI short-drama production. Use a two-level information architecture: global workbench for all projects, recent activity, global generation queue, system health and settings; project workspace for overview, scripts/storyboards, assets, generation, review and delivery. The upper-left brand control must be a real labeled sidebar collapse action, not a decorative icon. System Settings must open a functional settings center for ComfyUI connection, H3 paths, export defaults, storage visibility and UI preferences. Preserve restrained near-black surfaces and warm cinematic gold as the only primary accent. Project cards use real shot thumbnails and production statuses. Desktop-first at 1536px and usable at 900px. All visible icons must have a real interaction or be visually non-interactive.",
